@startuml get-cheers-sent-id
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/cheers/sent/{id}
caption CRB-37 · 보낸 요청 상세 + 공유받은 연락처. 공유 후 처음 열람 시 student_viewed_at 기록\nCRB-54 · 선배가 탈퇴했거나 탈퇴 유예기간 중이면 연락처(email · phone)를 내리지 않고 탈퇴 안내

actor Client
participant "UserGuard\n+ UserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseUUIDPipe" as Pipe
participant "CheersStudentController" as Controller
participant "CheersStudentService" as Service
participant "CoffeeChatRequestRepository" as CoffeeChatRequestRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/cheers/sent/<id>\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard
  UserGuard, UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @UserTypes(["student"]). 가입을 마친(active) 재학생만
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
  403 Signup is not completed / User type not allowed (현업자)
end ref
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt id가 UUID 형식이 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 Validation failed (uuid is expected)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getSentDetail(id, user)
Controller -> Service: getSentDetail(userPk, id)

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> CoffeeChatRequestRepository: findSentByPk(id, userPk, tx)
  CoffeeChatRequestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT r.*, g.pk, gp.nickname, gp.company, gp.job, u.name,\nisActiveAccount AS graduated_active\nFROM coffee_chat_request r\nJOIN student s ON s.pk = r.student_pk AND s.user_pk = ?\nJOIN graduated_profile gp\nJOIN graduated g JOIN users u ON u.pk = g.user_pk\nWHERE r.pk = ?
  note right: 내가 보낸 요청만 (다른 재학생의 요청은 없는 것으로 봄)
  CoffeeChatRequestRepository --> Service: row | null
  alt 요청 없음 또는 내가 보낸 요청이 아님
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Coffee chat request not found
  end

  opt contact_shared_at 있음 AND student_viewed_at 없음 (공유 후 처음 열람)
    Service -> CoffeeChatRequestRepository: markStudentViewed(id, tx)
    CoffeeChatRequestRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE coffee_chat_request\nSET student_viewed_at = now(), updated_at = now()\nWHERE pk = ? AND contact_shared_at IS NOT NULL\nAND student_viewed_at IS NULL
    note right: 처음 시각만 남김.\n동시에 두 번 열어도 조건 때문에 덮어쓰지 않음
  end
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답

Service -> Service: status 계산 (GET /api/v1/cheers/sent 와 같음)\ngraduated_withdrawn = NOT graduated_active
alt 공유 전 (contact_shared_at 없음)
  Service -> Service: shared_contact = null
else 공유됨 AND 현업자 활성 (graduated_active = true)
  Service -> Service: shared_contact = { name: u.name,\n  email: shared_email, phone: shared_phone,\n  shared_at: contact_shared_at }
else 공유됨 AND 현업자 탈퇴 또는 탈퇴 유예기간 중 (graduated_active = false)
  Service -> Service: shared_contact = { name: "탈퇴한 계정",\n  email: null, phone: null,\n  shared_at: contact_shared_at }
end
note right of Service
  CRB-54: 탈퇴한 선배의 연락처는 응답에서 뺌. 프론트는 graduated_withdrawn = true로
  "탈퇴한 선배입니다" 안내를 띄움 (연락처가 null인 이유를 구분하는 값).
  DB의 shared_email · shared_phone은 지우지 않음 (탈퇴 정책상 요청 기록 보관).
  유예기간 중 선배가 다시 로그인해 탈퇴를 취소하면 연락처가 다시 내려감.
  탈퇴 처리 후에는 users.name이 지워져 null이므로 name은 항상 "탈퇴한 계정"
end note
Service --> Controller: SentRequestDetailDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { id, graduated, graduated_withdrawn, message, status, created_at, shared_contact }

@enduml
